#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/linux-desktop-install.rst:121
msgid "Considerations"
msgstr "고려 사항"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/linux-desktop-install.rst:123
msgid ""
"The Flatpak version runs in a sandboxed environment, which may affect "
"certain integrations or file access patterns."
msgstr ""
"Flatpak 버전은 샌드박스 환경에서 실행되므로 특정 통합이나 파일 접근 패턴에 "
"영향을 줄 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/linux-desktop-install.rst:124
msgid "Automatic app updates are handled through the Flatpak update mechanism."
msgstr "자동 앱 업데이트는 Flatpak 업데이트 메커니즘을 통해 처리됩니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/linux-desktop-install.rst:125
msgid ""
"The application requires access to Flathub or a compatible Flatpak "
"repository for runtime dependencies."
msgstr ""
"이 애플리케이션은 런타임 종속성을 위해 Flathub 또는 호환되는 Flatpak 저장소에 "
"대한 접근이 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/linux-desktop-install.rst:133
msgid ""
"The Desktop app is available in two formats which are usable on most "
"Linux distributions: a compressed tarball, and an AppImage binary. Both "
"can be downloaded from the `Desktop App's Github releases page "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/desktop/releases>`_. Automatic app updates"
" are supported and enabled on AppImage binary builds. When a new version "
"of the desktop app is released, your app updates automatically."
msgstr ""
"데스크톱 앱은 대부분의 Linux 배포판에서 사용할 수 있는 두 가지 형식, 즉 압축 "
"tarball과 AppImage 바이너리로 제공됩니다. 둘 다 `데스크톱 앱의 Github 릴리스 "
"페이지 <https://github.com/mattermost/desktop/releases>`_\\ 에서 다운로드할 수 "
"있습니다. AppImage 바이너리 빌드에서는 자동 앱 업데이트가 지원되며 활성화되어 "
"있습니다. 데스크톱 앱의 새 버전이 릴리스되면 앱이 자동으로 업데이트됩니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/linux-desktop-install.rst:135
msgid ""
"For instructions on how to use the AppImage binary, please refer to the  "
"`AppImage Quickstart documentation page "
"<https://docs.appimage.org/introduction/quickstart.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"AppImage 바이너리 사용 방법에 대한 안내는 `AppImage 빠른 시작 문서 페이지 "
"<https://docs.appimage.org/introduction/quickstart.html>`_\\ 를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/linux-desktop-install.rst:138
msgid "Install the Desktop App's compressed tarball"
msgstr "데스크톱 앱의 압축 tarball 설치"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/linux-desktop-install.rst:140
msgid ""
"Download the latest version of the Mattermost desktop app for 64-bit "
"systems: `mattermost-desktop-6.2.0-linux-x64.tar.gz "
"<https://releases.mattermost.com/desktop/6.2.0/mattermost-"
"desktop-6.2.0-linux-x64.tar.gz>`_"
msgstr ""
"64비트 시스템용 OKR.BEST 데스크톱 앱의 최신 버전을 다운로드하세요: "
"`mattermost-desktop-6.2.0-linux-x64.tar.gz "
"<https://releases.mattermost.com/desktop/6.2.0/mattermost-"
"desktop-6.2.0-linux-x64.tar.gz>`_"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/linux-desktop-install.rst:142
msgid ""
"Extract the archive to a convenient location, then give ``chrome-"
"sandbox`` in the extracted directory the required ownership and "
"permissions: ``sudo chown root:root chrome-sandbox && sudo chmod 4755 "
"chrome-sandbox``"
msgstr ""
"압축을 편리한 위치에 풀고, 압축을 푼 디렉토리의 ``chrome-sandbox``\\ 에 필요한 "
"소유권과 권한을 부여하세요: ``sudo chown root:root chrome-sandbox && sudo "
"chmod 4755 chrome-sandbox``"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/linux-desktop-install.rst:144
msgid "Execute ``mattermost-desktop`` located inside the extracted directory."
msgstr "압축을 푼 디렉토리 안에 있는 ``mattermost-desktop``\\ 을 실행합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/linux-desktop-install.rst:146
msgid ""
"To create a Desktop launcher, open the file ``README.md``, and follow the"
" instructions in the **Desktop launcher** section."
msgstr ""
"데스크톱 실행기를 만들려면 ``README.md`` 파일을 열고 **Desktop launcher** "
"섹션의 안내를 따르세요."

